  "details": "While not exposed to the interface, the underlying transform a humanoid collider is assigned to can be overridden, however the inspector drawing code calls `UpdateAutoColliders` on each frame, which calls `UpdateConfig`, which in turn overrides any transform value with the one produced by `VRCAvatarDescriptor.Calc____Collider` methods, even when the collider is set to Custom configuration (or Disabled).",
